Outreach, actually, has been discussed here (brought up by Kennita, as I
recall) and at ExI-BATF meetings. I've also been present at a few
discussions with Max on the subject. Not to mention my efforts in the
metaverse that are focused on exposing moo-goers to Extropianism.

At ExI-BATF we decided to encourage the growth of alt.extropians. Romana is
writing the alt.extropians FAQv1.0, and we made a decision to have
"newbie-wranglers," or seasoned extropians "work" the newsgroup on a
rotating volunteer basis.

And I have discussed with several eminent extropians about toning down
certain aspects of the Extropy philosophy in order to not turn off people
instantly. I'm not recommending moonie-like deception here, but rather a
little less in-your-face style, and perhaps a decoupling with the publicly
hard to take serious word "libertarian" (Spontaneous Order is so thought
provoking anyway).

