In your defense Tim, this list is the inner sanctum, a safe haven for those
who wish to express frank extropian ideas and not get flamed. I for one, do
not ask you to censor yourself here. Even though your recent bought with
thin-skinnedness is getting on my nerves a little lately, I always look
forward to, and read avidly, your posts.

