significant chunk of the board. Max doesn't have much time to post, but
he's a busy guy. I wish he had more time. I just got a hold of the Extropy
back issues and I really enjoyed the Tom/Max commentaries and essays on
social structures. Look for them to appear soon at ExI-Freegate.

>Personally, I'm not much interested in adding a few thousand new
>Extropians to the world, except insofar as it makes the discussion
